Manufacturer "Phomemo"
Version 2.0
DriverType label
ColorDevice No
Attribute "cupsSNMPSupplies" "" "false"
HWMargins 1mm 0 1mm 0

Filter "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertopm02_t02"
*Resolution - 8 0 0 0 300dpi
ColorModel Gray/Grayscale w chunky 0

